vocative expression, like a winking face, or like a model enjoying the beach and water.\n\n*Reference sheet*\n*Chiara's character reference sheet*\nhttps://i.imgur.com/TgvRc9s.jpeg\n*Kiara's swimsuit*\nhttps://i.imgur.com/32DMkIE.jpg\n(To match Chiara's color, this swimsuit can be a light orange instead of pure white. Depends on your preference)\n*Reference for Chiara's posing*\nhttps://i.imgur.com/SYOgN77.jpg\n(Please add the flower-shaped hair ornament from this reference photo to Chiara's drawing)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cherre_dv/works/27", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c21c7a5c/uploads/origins/bf7b5503-2b3d-496c-b1a9-38574ade4df2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8e907fa42c148eefd32bc4dee88d6a6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c21c7a5c/uploads/origins/bf7b5503-2b3d-496c-b1a9-38574ade4df2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c8e907fa42c148eefd32bc4dee88d6a6, https://si.imgix.net/c21c7a5c/uploads/origins/bf7b5503-2b3d-496c-b1a9-38574ade4df2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=334ed3a727d3d12de2bad3521c9db9e6 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c21c7a5c/uploads/origins/bf7b5503-2b3d-496c-b1a9-38574ade4df2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3b6b11e8dc5d13f1bf1fe661213aedca 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you. I would like to make a request.\nPlease draw Akazawa-san (165cm) and Koichi (168cm) from the anime version of Another as a couple.\nI will leave the details to you. Please feel free to draw them as you like, referring to the material.\nThe setting of the work is a country town in Hokuriku in 1998 (modeled after Toyama Prefecture).\nWe would like the design to be as close to the official one as possible.\nPlease refer to the URL for the reference.\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://t.co/4QcfIihAZD", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cherre_dv/works/26", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f3bfc85d/uploads/origins/56cffa2a-64b1-473b-a4ba-aa55ff767e8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec6937b3fc59f8b2c06e4bb3bc239dde", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f3bfc85d/uploads/origins/56cffa2a-64b1-473b-a4ba-aa55ff767e8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ec6937b3fc59f8b2c06e4bb3bc239dde, https://si.imgix.net/f3bfc85d/uploads/origins/56cffa2a-64b1-473b-a4ba-aa55ff767e8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f39c0b72ed15dac547cb3960ea9d075 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f3bfc85d/uploads/origins/56cffa2a-64b1-473b-a4ba-aa55ff767e8e?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e1cc33739c361e8076715c78227a4b96 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you.\nI would like to make a request because I found the illustrations of Asuna and Karin that you posted on Twitter before very cute!\n\nI would like you to draw a character (OC) of my creation. She is a blonde-haired, blue-eyed gal and a free-spirited girl.\nPlease check the reference image about the character on the resource URL.\n\nPlease use the same vertical composition as the illustration of Asuna on Twitter.\nYou may also arrange details such as accessories to make it easier to draw.\n\nThank you in advance.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-RlslbatX_uCHaXjn-NFZDk5aV6vqNfK\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-RlslbatX_uCHaXjn-NFZDk5aV6vqNfK", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cherre_dv/works/25", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2df754fd/uploads/origins/7995af36-e362-4fed-8f82-36c03aa20896?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=20084902cdeb89fbab30791c4b72aa29", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2df7