n to you.\n\n\nWe have included an image (in-game image) at the URL of the document.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/pkUrhVf", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Cherre_dv/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/959cd7d1/uploads/origins/6dccd19a-aa17-4d35-a53d-4a7b4a9b3efa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02858dbbfd55d8e8684175ca4ed02790", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/959cd7d1/uploads/origins/6dccd19a-aa17-4d35-a53d-4a7b4a9b3efa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02858dbbfd55d8e8684175ca4ed02790, https://si.imgix.net/959cd7d1/uploads/origins/6dccd19a-aa17-4d35-a53d-4a7b4a9b3efa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b901a2c94c33af4872d2499b2ef7fd84 2x, https://si.imgix.net/959cd7d1/uploads/origins/6dccd19a-aa17-4d35-a53d-4a7b4a9b3efa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=90f9ed2ec8f9f300b9fd9c4677f00dc5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "I apologize for all the copyright requests, so I've been thinking about an original character? I've been thinking about it.\nI'm asking for a beautiful black-haired girl who looks cool but is a little slutty!\n\nI have come up with the following settings. Please refer to it.\nAppearance\nA beautiful girl with a dignified face and black hair (hair style is up to you).\nHigh school age, not too tall and not too small.\nShe has a healthy physique. Beautiful breasts (not too big, not too small, but a good balance).\n\nClothing\nPlease wear clothes that have absolute area + skirt.\n\n⬛︎Personality\nShe is a pain in the ass and sloppy, but on the surface she is cool. He can be serious when he is interested in something.\nShe spends most of her time alone, so when she's doing something (preoccupied), she often wears unprotected clothes.\n\nI'll leave the poses, expressions, etc. up to you!\nThank you!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"